#* {{quote-web|en|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20211209083131/https://www.taiwannews.com.tw/en/news/4370307|archivedate=09 December 2021|url=https://www.taiwannews.com.tw/en/news/4370307|work=w:Taiwan News|url2=https://archive.ph/WDYPs|passage=The use of the term "West Taiwan" (西台灣) to mock China has steadily grown in popularity since January 2020 when President Tsai Ing-wen (蔡英文) said that Beijing needs to face the reality that Taiwan is already an independent country. At the time, '''netizens''' conjured terms such as "Mainland Taiwan," "Taiwanese Beijing," and "West Taiwan" to agitate Chinese nationalists, censors, and trolls.|title=German video game ad labels China {{'}}West Taiwan{{'}}|date=2021-12-09|author=Keoni Everington}}

